 useEffect(()=>{if(authChecked.current)return;authChecked.current=true;handleAuthCallback().then(async result=>{if(!result){const current=await getUser();if(current){setUser(current);await syncRef.current();}return;}if(result.type==='invite'){setInviteToken(result.token||'');setModal('password');}else if(result.type==='recovery'){setUser(result.user);setModal('password');}else{setUser(result.user);setModal('login');setNotice('Account verified. Use your existing session to open the live CRM.');}}).catch(e=>setNotice(e.message)).finally(()=>setAuthLoading(false));},[]);
